    <cac:ProcurementLegislationDocumentReference>
      <cbc:ID>Anskaffelsesforskriften</cbc:ID>
      
      <cbc:DocumentDescription languageID="ENG">The choice of system follows the established cooperation structure in the region and it is necessary to achieve the planned gains. The procurement is therefore carried out as a direct procurement from the supplier already used by the Kongsberg region, in accordance with the Public Procurement Regulations (FOA) §13-4 letter b.</cbc:DocumentDescription>
    </cac:ProcurementLegislationDocumentReference>
